= Confronting Class-Ds

How should we address the growing mob of Class-D personnels?

- @curb: Curb the mob of Class-Ds causing trouble.
- @root: We either don't want to or cannot do anything about them right now.
- @easy_discard

@curb
subtitle: -2 resources
view-if: class_d_riot >= 0.6
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; class_d_riot -= 0.15; ethics_committee_relation -= 3

We have utilize our security personnels to deal with the Class-Ds, however, the ethics committee condemns our actions, saying it was not the appropriate response towards the Class-Ds.
